				Chat {/me will be the leader of this group. Starting Bloodstone Investigation}
				DoExpr {setgvar[RalliedChars,listcreate[]]}
	IF:	Expr {testpvar[Trinkets]!=0}
		DO:	DoExpr {$TurnInEquipment=1}
	IF:	SecsInStateGE 5
		DO:	SetState {Buffing}
~~ }
STATE: {Buffing} ~~ {
	IF:	Always
		DO:	DoAll
				SetOpt {EnableBuffing} {True}
				Chat {/vt forcebuff}
